    "review.zebra-medical.zebra.medical.vision.now.part": "Zebra Medical Vision, now part of Nanox AI, is a pioneering platform in automated radiology analysis, deploying over 12 AI algorithms across more than 1,000 hospitals worldwide. Founded in 2014, Zebra was among the first companies to develop comprehensive AI solutions for detecting multiple conditions from medical imaging studies. The platform analyzes CT scans, MRIs, and X-rays to identify a wide range of abnormalities including cardiovascular disease, liver conditions, bone health issues, and lung pathologies.",
    "review.zebra-medical.what.distinguishes.zebra.medical.vision": "What distinguishes Zebra Medical Vision is its \"All-in-One\" approach, where a single integration provides hospitals access to multiple AI algorithms that work across different imaging modalities and clinical conditions. Rather than deploying separate AI tools for each condition, Zebra's unified platform automatically analyzes studies for dozens of findings simultaneously. This comprehensive screening approach helps radiologists catch incidental findings that might otherwise be overlooked and prioritizes urgent cases requiring immediate attention.",
